    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. Use it as your opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, on one friendly **SMOKE** unit. Until that phase is over, any attack aimed at that unit, or at a unit the attacker cannot [fully see](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) because models in your chosen **SMOKE** unit block the view, gives its target the [Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover). Like any Stratagem, it can be used only [once in a phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
